<title>UK: Airbus delivers A330-300 to Garuda.</title>
<headline>Airbus delivers A330-300 to Garuda.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airbus Industrie said on Wednesday that airline Garuda Indonesia took delivery of its first A330-300 widebody airliner.</p>
<p>Garuda took delivery of the aircraft in Toulouse, Airbus said in a statement released in London. It said Garuda has placed firm orders for nine of the twin-engine airliners.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4107</p>
